      "font_role": "sans-bold",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "골라라:"
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b6:l1:s1-1",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        6,
        1,
        1,
        1
      ],
      "source": " on the answer sheet which reagent(s) and/or condition is/are appropri-",
      "rect": [
        144.44085693359375,
        358.53497314453125,
        480.5705871582031,
        372.1040344238281
      ],
      "point": [
        144.44085693359375,
        369.18499755859375
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "다이옥사보롤레인 말레이미드 단위 결합에 적절한 시약 및/또는 조건을."
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b6:l2:s0-0",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        6,
        2,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "ate for linking the dioxaborolane maleimide units to",
      "rect": [
        114.69100189208984,
        370.4899597167969,
        357.80841064453125,
        384.05902099609375
      ],
      "point": [
        114.69100189208984,
        381.1399841308594
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "답은 답안지에 표시한다. 결합할 고분자는"
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b6:l2:s1-1",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        6,
        2,
        1,
        1
      ],
      "source": " polyethylene",
      "rect": [
        357.80841064453125,
        370.4899597167969,
        425.3712158203125,
        384.05902099609375
      ],
      "point": [
        357.80841064453125,
        381.1399841308594
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans-Bold",
      "font_role": "sans-bold",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "폴리에틸렌이다"
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b9:l0:s0-0",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        9,
        0,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "The vitrimer was prepared as follows:",
      "rect": [
        56.69300079345703,
        564.2069702148438,
        231.5067596435547,
        577.7760620117188
      ],
      "point": [
        56.69300079345703,
        574.8569946289062
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "비트리머는 다음과 같이 만들었다:"
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b10:l0:s0-4",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        10,
        0,
        0,
        4
      ],
      "source": "• Polyethylene is grafted with dioxaborolane maleimide. Assume no side reactions between the diox-",
      "rect": [
        72.87200164794922,
        596.0869750976562,
        538.5845336914062,
        609.6560668945312
      ],
      "point": [
        72.87200164794922,
        606.7369995117188
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "• 폴리에틸렌에 다이옥사보롤레인 말레이미드를 그래프트한다. 다이옥사보롤레인"
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b10:l1:s0-0",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        10,
        1,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "source": "aborolane maleimide compounds.",
      "rect": [
        81.5999984741211,
        608.0419921875,
        241.94805908203125,
        621.611083984375
      ],
      "point": [
        81.5999984741211,
        618.6920166015625
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "말레이미드 화합물 사이에는 부반응이 없다고 가정하라."
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b11:l0:s0-2",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        11,
        0,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "• The reagents are removed from the macromolecules.",
      "rect": [
        72.87200164794922,
        626.970947265625,
        330.8443908691406,
        640.5400390625
      ],
      "point": [
        72.87200164794922,
        637.6209716796875
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "• 시약들을 고분자로부터 제거한다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b12:l0:s0-2",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        12,
        0,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "• Propanediol functionalized bis-dioxaborolane is added to enable crosslinking.",
      "rect": [
        72.87200164794922,
        645.8999633789062,
        443.66082763671875,
        659.4690551757812
      ],
      "point": [
        72.87200164794922,
        656.5499877929688
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "• 프로페인다이올 작용기를 갖는 비스-다이옥사보롤레인을 넣어 가교가 가능하도록 한다."
    },
    {
      "id": "p45:b14:l0:s0-2",
      "page": 45,
      "at": [
        14,
        0,
        0,
        2
      ],
      "source": "• The mixture is carefully heated for metathesis (exchange) reaction to take place.",
      "rect": [
        72.87200164794922,
        765.4559936523438,
        455.4266357421875,
        779.0250854492188
      ],
      "point": [
        72.87200164794922,
        776.1060180664062
      ],
      "font": "NotoSans",
      "font_role": "sans",
      "size": 9.962599754333496,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "• 혼합물을 조심스럽게 가열하여 복분해(교환) 반응이 일어나게 한다."
    }
